Z\",\"createdBy\":\"s-createdby\",\"createdByType\":\"s-createdbytype\",\"lastModifiedAt\":\"2026-11-06T10:00:00Z\",\"lastModifiedBy\":\"s-lastmodifiedby\",\"lastModifiedByType\":\"s-lastmodifiedbytype\"},\"tags\":{\"k1\":\"s-tags\"},\"type\":\"s-type\"}]}")
